{
  "meta": {
    "name": "Effects tour: sound",
    "description": "Chapter 9 of the effects tour: a 120 BPM beat grid with a click track and camera hits on every beat, automatic hits and whooshes, every bundled sound effect placed on its motion event (click, tick, pop, whoosh, swoosh-short, shutter, riser, boom, hit, ding), and the five voice presets on a voice-like recording with a volume fade-up.",
    "creativeDirection": "Listen with the picture: every sound lands on the frame of its visual event and is named on screen. The beat grid proves sync (each count pops on its click), the riser ends exactly on the drop, the voice beats change only the processing. Review: no sound before its picture, the ding is the only one, and voices stay clear without pumping."
  },
